  "summary": "The Gurobi Optimizer is a state-of-the-art solver for mathematical programming. The solvers in the Gurobi Optimizer were designed from the ground up to exploit modern architectures and multi-core processors, using the most advanced implementations of the latest algorithms. It is capable of solving the following problem types:\n\n    linear programming solver (LP)\n    mixed-integer linear programming solver (MILP)\n    mixed-integer quadratic programming solver (MIQP)\n    quadratic programming solver (QP)\n    quadratically constrained programming solver (QCP)\n    mixed-integer quadratically constrained programming solver (MIQCP)",
  "title": "Gurobi Optimizer",
